# Webflow → Astro. Every URL the live site publishes, pointed at its new home.
#
# Cloudflare takes the FIRST match, so specific rules sit above the wildcards
# that back them up. Drafted from the live sitemap (28 URLs) plus three pages
# that are indexed but absent from it — which is the reason this file is not
# finished: a sitemap is what a site says it publishes, not what Google knows
# about. Before cutover, export Search Console's page list and diff it against
# the left-hand column here.

# ── Pages that changed name ──
